-miqsPr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuhpptii3gP8EamfrQ5yM4wTqR0iFSHr6ZoV3LnnBV0kQ&oe=69A1A429"}, {"file_name": "secreenshopt4.png", "id": "1142124994049014", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1142124997382347_1053989313703959917_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kgg549p_s04Q7kNvwG-tHTM&_nc_oc=AdnTCtkhi336qI220pkRhSg_kWVkMqiSUp7RjAhZ9956wRgx9wKi3eFfrKYyE-ACaTU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftE2AlvgUPdKHGrav7ar4sEZZN95cvAcMBwWT_gjYd4xA&oe=69A17AD1"}, {"file_name": "secreenshopt6.png", "id": "633131099170368", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391932_633131102503701_7992954763248169413_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x_VStzDYhU0Q7kNvwHfObt2&_nc_oc=Adm7Fi0SP3yhGsiDXXW0G10qsm87ZqSfzH9XXSb6xk694Urei3EjXoxHGj2iiNf4f8c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuIkNI6ndWVttd63qGuxjcII6Jcv-EfRIbaJlIA0MszMA&oe=69A1806E"}, {"file_name": "secreenshopt3.png", "id": "1872246483522769", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819961_1872246486856102_6494395123104062285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2NS1MYbEu7QQ7kNvwELkStQ&_nc_oc=AdkJ1SPK3B03Rg2IMJpUd_hpjIrK6Ubppr1Eq_DnqOvy9Aga8LGPaYZ5oCJlJ_Jc_kc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftPHEJQAHm_EXZHNMScnydg-Bv9YbSRrAUxcTcbdnPhCg&oe=69A19C10"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ClawMatchTralier_2560x1440-\u5c01\u9762.png", "id": "1864746831044218", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1864746837710884_6542806525797600865_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6zZIiG0JGQoQ7kNvwH68Vzd&_nc_oc=AdkIL9guz3YUXCaUPa1ZrpWBPyMgaKHSBEHJxY33CIfDmm5VbfW0Jr_XwvlLvKiCQCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftcW9X1sRBEkAjaOOG2T4oKoH5eowwINhreG2pqs0ymjg&oe=69A19B9D"}, "display_name": "Claw Match", "keywords": ["ClawMachine", "Simulator", "3Match", "Claw", "Arcade"], "long_description": "Claw Match combines the authentic claw machine experience with match-3 gameplay, taking you into a creative world of claw machines. In this game, you\u2019ll operate the claw machine with precision while using match-3 mechanics to tackle tasks, offering a fresh strategy and exciting gameplay!\n\nGame Features:\n\n\t1.\tClaw Machine Simulator: Operate the claw machine, and feel every movement of the claw.\n{1834277427325409}\n\t2.\tUnique Match-3 Experience: Combine claw machine gameplay with match-3 elements for a new elimination challenge.\n{665481632537449}\n\t3.\tFun Creative Levels: Each level is uniquely designed to enhance the claw machine fun, providing a rich gaming experience.\n{2166243717166315}\n\t4.\tHundreds of Fun Objects: From cute plush toys to creative items, see how many interesting objects you can grab.\n{579768198411871}\n\t5.\tRealistic Physical Feedback: With a precise physics engine and controller vibrations, experience every detail of the claw machine action.\n\nCreative Levels:\n\n\t\u2022\tDolls: Grab various adorable animal plush toys and unlock more.\n\t\u2022\tYammy Sushi: Feel like you\u2019re in a conveyor belt sushi restaurant. Grab your favorite sushi.\n\t\u2022\tFruit World: Grab delicious fruits and complete match-3 tasks in a vibrant fruit world.\n\t\u2022\tMini Cars: Grab moving mini cars on a racetrack.\n\t\u2022\tCasino: Grab lucky coins in a casino-themed claw machine.\n\t\u2022\tAnimals vs Zombies: Protect your animal friends by fending off zombies while grabbing toys and solving match-3 puzzles.\n", "short_description": "Claw Match combines the authentic claw machine experience with match-3 gameplay, transporting you into a creative world of claw machines. In this game, you not only need to operate the claw machine with precision, but also use match-3 mechanics to continuously challenge tasks, offering a fresh strategy and exciting gameplay !\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Gulita Studio", "d